#: ../../library/network.WINC.rst:5
msgid "class WINC -- WiFi shield driver"
msgstr "class WINC -- controlador del escudo WiFi"

#: ../../library/network.WINC.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`WINC` class drives the Atmel WINC1500 802.11 b/g/n WiFi module "
"on the OpenMV WiFi Shield. Available on the OpenMV Cam M4, M7, H7, H7 Plus "
"and Pure Thermal (the STM32 boards that the WiFi shield was designed for). "
"For boards with built-in WiFi (OpenMV Cam N6, OpenMV Cam RT1062, Arduino "
"Giga) use :class:`WLAN` instead."
msgstr ""
"La clase :class:`WINC` controla el módulo WiFi Atmel WINC1500 802.11 b/g/n "
"del OpenMV WiFi Shield. Disponible en la OpenMV Cam M4, M7, H7, H7 Plus y "
"Pure Thermal (las placas STM32 para las que se diseñó el escudo WiFi). Para "
"placas con WiFi integrado (OpenMV Cam N6, OpenMV Cam RT1062, Arduino Giga) "
"usa :class:`WLAN` en su lugar."

